<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Pogo Producing said raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Pogo Producing said raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Pogo Producing Co was raised by Oppenheimer to an outperform from its prior rating of market perform, according to a trading source.</p>
<p>-- Pogo shares closed at 35-3/8 on Friday.</p>
</text>
